Package: oplite
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Orbivisor developers <gaiger777@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: orbivisor (= @VERSION@)
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gaiger777/opLite
Description: transitional package for orbivisor
 opLite was renamed to Orbivisor. This package moves an installed oplite
 to the orbivisor package. It can be removed.
